# Build output
build/
out/
target/
*.jar
# The wrapper jar must be committed or ./gradlew does not work on a fresh clone.
# The pattern needs ** because the wrapper lives under backend/, not the repo root.
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Gradle
.gradle/

# Local runtime data
data/
uploads/

# Secrets
.env
*.local

# Node (only used for the browser verification script)
node_modules/
package-lock.json
# Byproduct of `npm install playwright`, which the browser verification needs.
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: a real manifest added under
# frontend/ or elsewhere should still be tracked.
/package.json

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Working notes. lessons.md는 지적받은 패턴의 누적 기록이라 추적하고,
# todo.md는 작업 중에만 의미가 있는 체크리스트라 로컬에만 둔다.
tasks/todo.md
